{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Experimental.terminal_resolution","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Experimental.terminal_resolution","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.TerminalResolution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.TerminalResolution","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Experimental/terminal_resolution.lean#L37-L53","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript), named as a `Prop`:\n\nUsing the derived `q₀`, the hadronic mass collapses into a linear\ncombination of the neutrino vacuum drag and the pure strong-force\nbinding energy, matching CODATA to sub-keV precision:\n\n  `mass = m_nu_drag + E_strong  ∧  |mass − mass_codata| ≤ tol`.\n\nThis is the §3b \"name the conditional conjecture\" disposition (pattern\nC): `TerminalResolution ctx` is the proposition the manuscript\nconjectures for the physical data `ctx`; the open state is honestly\nrepresented by the absence of an instance.  It is *not* a self-assuming\nprojection. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:terminal-resolution","label":"prop:terminal-resolution","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/terminal-resolution.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.TerminalResolutionContext.tol","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.TerminalResolutionContext.tol","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Experimental/terminal_resolution.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Sub-keV tolerance threshold (`< 0.001` MeV). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.TerminalResolutionContext.mass_codata","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.TerminalResolutionContext.mass_codata","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Experimental/terminal_resolution.lean#L33-L33","doc":"CODATA experimental mass. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.TerminalResolutionContext.E_strong","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.TerminalResolutionContext.E_strong","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Experimental/terminal_resolution.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Strong-force binding energy contribution `E_strong`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.TerminalResolutionContext.m_nu_drag","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.TerminalResolutionContext.m_nu_drag","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Experimental/terminal_resolution.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Neutrino-vacuum-drag contribution `m_ν`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.TerminalResolutionContext.mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.TerminalResolutionContext.mass","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Experimental/terminal_resolution.lean#L27-L27","doc":"Predicted hadronic mass. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.TerminalResolutionContext.CategoricalObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.TerminalResolutionContext.CategoricalObj","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Experimental/terminal_resolution.lean#L25-L25","doc":"The categorical object / monoidal structure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":